# Handoff

- Follow root `AGENTS.md` (shared with Codex). Only one assistant edits that file at a time.
- Before starting, read `docs/CURSOR_HANDOFF.md` and `docs/CODEX_HANDOFF.md`.
- After a completed task, update **only** `docs/CURSOR_HANDOFF.md` (facts, scores, blockers, owned paths, next step). Do not edit `docs/CODEX_HANDOFF.md`.
- Do not edit paths Codex lists as owned. Do not invent progress.
- Keep the long screenshot-import history in the Cursor handoff. Do not copy it into this rule.
